{"step_index":2374,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:54:29Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":false,\"Summary\":\"DNC button clarification, modal confirmation, and 1-tap Reinstate to Queue toggle added and deployed live.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Walkthrough: DNC Compliance Button Clarification & 1-Tap Reinstatement\\n\\n## 1. Features Added & Refined\\n- **DNC / Reinstate Dynamic Toggle ([`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)):**\\n  - **Active Lead:** Displays **`🛡️ DNC`** with confirmation prompt (*\\\"Flag [Educator] as Do Not Call? This will permanently remove them from all active calling queues.\\\"*).\\n  - **Flagged Lead:** Displays an emerald **`🔄 Reinstate`** button so representatives can easily reverse/correct accidental DNC flags.\\n  - **Reinstatement Prompt:** Prompts (*\\\"Reinstate [Educator]? This removes the DNC flag and returns them to your active calling queue as Ready to Call.\\\"*).\\n  - **Visual Feedback:** Shows persistent top toast notification (`🛡️ Flagged as Do Not Call` or `✓ Lead reinstated to active calling queue.`).\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. How to Reverse the Accidental DNC Flag\\n1. Open the educator profile that was flagged as DNC.\\n2. In the quick action buttons row, tap the green **`🔄 Reinstate`** button.\\n3. Confirm in the dialog prompt.\\n4. The lead is immediately restored to **`READY TO CALL`** and returned to your active Power Dialing queue.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 3. Live Production Deployment\\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**\\n\"","Description":"\"Update walkthrough with DNC clarification and reinstatement guide\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\walkthrough.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing walkthrough.md\"","toolSummary":"\"Update walkthrough.md\""}}]}
