{"step_index":2376,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:54:32Z","content":"### 🛡️ DNC Clarification & 1-Tap Reinstatement Deployed!\n\n---\n\n### 1. How to Reverse / Correct the Accidental DNC Flag:\n1. Open the educator profile that was marked as DNC.\n2. In the quick action buttons row (next to *Call Now* and *Draft Text*), you will now see an emerald **`🔄 Reinstate`** button.\n3. Tap **`🔄 Reinstate`** and confirm in the prompt.\n4. The educator is immediately restored to **`READY TO CALL`** and re-inserted into your active Power Dialing queue.\n\n---\n\n### 2. 🛠️ Enhancements Implemented ([`LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx)):\n\n```\n┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│               CLEAR COMPLIANCE TOGGLE & REINSTATEMENT                  │\n├────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤\n│ • If Lead is Active ➔ [ 🛡️ DNC ]                                       │\n│   Tapping prompts: \"Flag Jane Doe as Do Not Call? This will             │\n│   permanently remove them from all active calling queues.\"             │\n│                                                                        │\n│ • If Lead is DNC    ➔ [ 🔄 Reinstate ]                                 │\n│   Tapping prompts: \"Reinstate Jane Doe? This removes the DNC flag      │\n│   and returns them to your active calling queue as Ready to Call.\"     │\n│                                                                        │\n│ • Top Visual Banner ➔ Displays a confirmation toast on both mobile     │\n│   and web browsers (e.g. \"✓ Lead reinstated to active calling queue.\") │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Production Deployment\nThe update is compiled and live on Surge:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
